    {{ L", ", L"、" }},
    {{ L"- The session vault keeps the versions of every list of the last 30 days (at least the 20 latest), outside Claude's folders, in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Claude Desktop Profiles Manager\\vault: Recover sessions puts one back.\n- Before this program changes a list, it saves what it replaces (the last 20 changes).\n- A conversation deleted in Claude stays on this PC until it is cleaned up: Recently deleted brings it back.\n- Once a week, when Claude is closed, the .claude folder is copied beside it as .claude_auto_<date>; only the two latest copies are kept, the older ones are removed.", L"- 会话保险库保存每份列表最近 30 天的版本（至少保留最新的 20 个），放在 Claude 的文件夹之外，位于 %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Claude Desktop Profiles Manager\\vault：“恢复会话列表”可以把其中一个版本放回去。\n- 本程序修改列表之前，会先保存被替换的内容（最近 20 次修改）。\n- 在 Claude 里删除的对话会一直留在这台电脑上，直到被清理：“最近删除”可以把它找回来。\n- 每周一次，在 Claude 关闭时，.claude 文件夹会被复制到它旁边，名为 .claude_auto_<日期>；只保留最新的两份，更早的会被删除。" }},
    {{ L"<name>", L"<名称>" }},
    {{ L"A Code conversation is saved in two parts.\n\nIts content is saved once for every profile, in the .claude folder of your user folder (%USERPROFILE%\\.claude).\n\nThe list on the left of Claude (titles, stars, archived conversations) is saved by each profile in its own folder: Main's inside Claude's app folder, which uninstalling Claude removes; the others' in %APPDATA%\\Claude-<name>. Claude shows only the conversations its list names.", L"Code 对话分两部分保存。\n\n它的内容为所有配置文件只保存一份，放在你的用户文件夹下的 .claude 文件夹里（%USERPROFILE%\\.claude）。\n\nClaude 左侧的列表（标题、星标、已归档的对话）由每个配置文件保存在自己的文件夹里：Main 的在 Claude 的应用文件夹里，卸载 Claude 时会被删除；其他配置文件的在 %APPDATA%\\Claude-<名称>。Claude 只显示它的列表里记着的对话。" }},
