    {{ L"Claude alone has one sign-in and one list of conversations. Here each profile has its own folder, so its own sign-in, settings and list, while the content of the conversations stays in one place for all of them.\n\nClaude does not let profiles share one list: it does not save into a linked folder. So this program copies the changes from one list to the others, and keeps their recent versions.", L"单独使用 Claude 时，只有一个登录和一份对话列表。这里每个配置文件都有自己的文件夹，所以有自己的登录、设置和列表，而对话内容对所有配置文件都只存在一个地方。\n\nClaude 不允许配置文件共用一份列表：它不会往链接的文件夹里保存。所以这个程序会把一份列表的变化复制到其他列表，并保存它们最近的版本。" }},
