    {{ L"Claude no longer saves the sessions of “%s”: its session folder is linked to the one of “%s”, and Claude refuses to write through a link, so what changes there is lost once it closes.\n\nGive it a folder of its own again, and keep its sessions the same as those of “%s” instead?", L"Claude 已不再保存“%s”的会话：它的会话文件夹链接到了“%s”的文件夹，而 Claude 拒绝通过链接写入，所以那里的更改在关闭后就会丢失。\n\n要重新给它一个自己的文件夹，并改为让它的会话与“%s”保持一致吗？" }},
