    {{ L"Delete %d sessions everywhere?\n\nTheir conversations, their entries in every profile and the working folders of those without a folder go to the Recycle Bin.", L"从所有位置删除 %d 个会话吗？\n\n它们的对话记录、在每个配置文件中的条目，以及无文件夹会话的工作文件夹，都将移至回收站。" }},
