    {{ L"Delete the profile “%s”?\n\nIts data folder (sign-in, local history, Claude Code and Cowork files) goes to the Recycle Bin and its shortcuts are removed.", L"删除配置文件“%s”吗？\n\n其数据文件夹（登录信息、本地历史记录、Claude Code 和 Cowork 文件）将移至回收站，快捷方式也将删除。" }},
    {{ L"Delete the profile “%s”?\n\nIts folder is a link to\n%s\nThe data in that folder stays on disk. The link, the profile's shortcuts and Claude's local files for it (logs and cache) are removed.", L"删除配置文件“%s”吗？\n\n其文件夹链接到\n%s\n目标文件夹的数据将保留在磁盘上。链接、快捷方式以及 Claude 的本地日志和缓存将被删除。" }},
    {{ L"Delete the profiles %s?\n\nTheir data folders (sign-in, local history, Claude Code and Cowork files) go to the Recycle Bin, except a folder that is a link, which stays on disk. Their shortcuts are removed.", L"删除配置文件 %s 吗？\n\n其数据文件夹（登录信息、本地历史记录、Claude Code 和 Cowork 文件）将移至回收站，链接形式的文件夹除外，它会保留在磁盘上。其快捷方式也将删除。" }},
