    {{ L"In no list", L"不在任何列表中" }},
    {{ L"In the Sessions menu, choose Recently deleted…: it lists the conversations that no profile shows any more but that are still on this PC. Check the ones you want back and click Restore: they come back in every profile that listed them; in a profile that is open, once it has been closed and opened again.\n\nDelete moves the ones checked to the Recycle Bin, so that nothing brings them back.", L"在“会话”菜单里选择“最近删除…”：这里列出没有任何配置文件再显示、但仍在这台电脑上的对话。勾选想找回的对话，点击“恢复”：它们会回到每个曾列出它们的配置文件里；如果那个配置文件正开着，要等它关闭并重新打开后才会出现。\n\n“删除”会把勾选的对话移到回收站，这样就不会再被带回。" }},
    {{ L"Indigo", L"靛蓝色" }},
    {{ L"Installing the new version…", L"正在安装新版本…" }},
    {{ L"It lets you use several Claude accounts on one PC, each in its own window: a profile. Each profile has its own sign-in, settings and list of conversations. Claude itself is not changed: this program only starts it with a separate folder for each profile.\n\nIt can also keep the Code conversations of several profiles the same, so that you can switch to another account and go on where you left off.", L"它让你在一台电脑上使用多个 Claude 账号，每个账号在自己的窗口里，也就是一个配置文件。每个配置文件有自己的登录、设置和对话列表。Claude 本身不会被修改：这个程序只是用每个配置文件各自的文件夹来启动它。\n\n它还可以让多个配置文件的 Code 对话保持一致，这样你换到另一个账号后可以接着之前的地方继续。" }},
    {{ L"Its data will be kept in %%APPDATA%%\\%s.", L"数据将保存在 %%APPDATA%%\\%s。" }},
    {{ L"Its files could not all be listed (error %lu): %s", L"无法列出其全部文件（错误 %lu）：%s" }},
    {{ L"Its own, kept apart", L"独立保存，不同步" }},
    {{ L"Its working folder could not be copied.", L"无法复制其工作文件夹。" }},
    {{ L"Keep the data of these profiles (unchecked ones go to the Recycle Bin):", L"保留以下配置文件的数据（未勾选配置文件的数据将移至回收站）：" }},
    {{ L"Keep the same", L"保持一致" }},
    {{ L"Keep the sessions of %s the same?\n\nFrom then on, each time one of them closes or opens, what changed in one goes to the others: new sessions, titles, stars, pins and groups, archived and deleted ones. A session two of them went on with apart is kept as two. One that loses its list, when Claude is reinstalled, gets it back.", L"让 %s 的会话保持一致？\n\n此后每当其中一个关闭或打开时，一个配置文件中的更改都会同步到其他配置文件：新会话、标题、星标、置顶和分组、已归档和已删除的会话。两个配置文件各自继续过的同一会话会保留为两个会话。重新安装 Claude 后丢失会话列表的配置文件会找回它。" }},
    {{ L"Keeping sessions the same…", L"正在同步会话…" }},
    {{ L"Kept profiles stay in %APPDATA%: a new install finds them again, with default names and colors.", L"保留的配置文件仍位于 %APPDATA%：重新安装后会再次找到它们，并使用默认名称和颜色。" }},
