    {{ L"Remove %d sessions from “%s”?\n\nTheir entries there go to the Recycle Bin. Their conversations stay on disk: Delete sessions everywhere removes them too.", L"将 %d 个会话从“%s”中移除吗？\n\n该配置文件中的条目将移至回收站。对话记录仍保留在磁盘上；选择“从所有位置删除会话”才会一并删除。" }},
