    {{ L"Repair", L"修复" }},
    {{ L"Repair Claude Desktop Profiles Manager?\n\nIt registers the program again, puts its taskbar pins, shortcuts and icons right, gives the profiles whose session folder is still a link one of their own (their sessions kept the same instead), drops the changes waiting for profiles that are gone, then keeps every profile's sessions.", L"修复 Claude Desktop Profiles Manager？\n\n将重新注册本程序，修正任务栏固定项、快捷方式和图标，为会话文件夹仍是链接的配置文件恢复独立的文件夹（改为保持会话一致），丢弃已删除配置文件的待处理更改，然后保存每个配置文件的会话。" }},
    {{ L"Repaired. Session folders given back: %d. Waiting changes of profiles that are gone dropped: %d.", L"修复完成。恢复的会话文件夹：%d。丢弃的已删除配置文件的待处理更改：%d。" }},
