    {{ L"Their own, kept apart", L"各自独立，不同步" }},
    {{ L"These conversations are on this PC, but no profile lists them any more: deleted in Claude, or made in a terminal for example.\nRestore puts the ones checked back in the profiles that listed them. Delete removes them, so that nothing brings them back.", L"这些对话在这台电脑上，但已没有任何配置文件列出它们：在 Claude 中删除的，或例如在终端里创建的。\n“恢复”会把勾选的对话放回曾列出它们的配置文件。“删除”会移除它们，这样就不会再被带回。" }},
