    {{ L"This shortcut opens the Claude profile “%s”, which no longer exists.\n\nOpen Claude Desktop Profiles Manager?", L"此快捷方式用于打开已不存在的 Claude 配置文件“%s”。\n\n要打开 Claude Desktop Profiles Manager 吗？" }},
