    {{ L"Uninstall Claude Desktop Profiles Manager", L"卸载 Claude Desktop Profiles Manager" }},
    {{ L"Uninstalling Claude removes Main's folder: its sign-in, settings and list. The conversations in .claude stay, and so do the other profiles.\n\nBefore: quit Claude, right-click Main and choose Back up…, then choose Back up .claude… in the Sessions menu.\n\nAfter installing Claude again: open Main from this program, sign in with the same account, then quit it. If its sessions are kept the same as another profile's, its list comes back by itself; if not, use Recover sessions… in the Sessions menu.\n\nUninstalling this program asks which profiles to keep: keep them all.", L"卸载 Claude 会删除 Main 的文件夹：它的登录、设置和列表。.claude 里的对话会保留，其他配置文件也会保留。\n\n卸载前：退出 Claude，右键单击 Main 并选择“备份…”，再在“会话”菜单里选择“备份 .claude…”。\n\n重新安装 Claude 后：从这个程序打开 Main，用同一个账号登录，然后退出它。如果它的会话与另一个配置文件保持一致，它的列表会自动回来；否则请在“会话”菜单里使用“恢复会话列表…”。\n\n卸载这个程序时会询问保留哪些配置文件：全部保留。" }},
