    {{ L"“%s” has no folder. Shared with “%s”, it shows there in a folder named %s, not under No folder, and both profiles go on with the same conversation.\n\nFor a separate copy under No folder in “%s”, use Copy instead.\n\n%s, and its title there is set when %s closes.", L"“%s”没有文件夹。共享给“%s”后，它会出现在名为 %s 的文件夹中，而不是“No folder”分类下；两个配置文件将继续同一段对话。\n\n如需在“%s”的“No folder”分类下创建独立副本，请使用“复制”。\n\n%s，该配置文件中的标题将在 %s 关闭后设置。" }},
    {{ L"“%s” has no folder. Shared with “%s”, it shows there in a folder named %s, not under No folder, and both profiles go on with the same conversation.\n\nFor a separate copy under No folder in “%s”, use Copy instead.\n\n%s.", L"“%s”没有文件夹。共享给“%s”后，它会出现在名为 %s 的文件夹中，而不是“No folder”分类下；两个配置文件将继续同一段对话。\n\n如需在“%s”的“No folder”分类下创建独立副本，请使用“复制”。\n\n%s。" }},
