    {{ L"“%s” is not signed in to Claude yet: sign in there first.", L"“%s”尚未登录 Claude：请先在其中登录。" }},
    {{ L"“%s” is open. Quit Claude there now? Otherwise this question comes back once it is closed.", L"“%s”正在打开。现在退出它的 Claude 吗？否则，关闭后会再次询问。" }},
    {{ L"“%s” is open: the sessions of “%s” are made the same as its own only once it closes.\n\nQuit it first?", L"“%s”已打开：“%s”的会话要等它关闭后才会与它保持一致。\n\n先退出它吗？" }},
    {{ L"“%s” only has sessions run over SSH, in WSL or in the cloud.\nTheir conversation is not on this PC, so they are not listed.", L"“%s”只有通过 SSH、在 WSL 或云端运行的会话。\n其对话记录不在此电脑上，因此不会显示在列表中。" }},
